          "author": "Hello Earthling with Bonnie Wright ",
          "description": "The Hello Earthling Podcast is a joyful, family-friendly kids' podcast hosted by Bonnie Wright. Each episode features children from around the world sharing how they explore nature with curiosity, imagination, and all their senses. Through playful themes like “Things with Wings” and “If the Earth Could Talk,” kids’ voices and Bonnie’s gentle narration spark wonder and help families slow down, listen, and reconnect with our planet. We believe children deserve calm, curious media.",
